投入较高，但凭借更低能耗优势，长期经济性更加突出。\n再次，液冷应用场景持续扩展，产业空间不断打开。除AI服务器外，液冷正加速向交换机、光模块等环节渗透。随着800G光模块成为主流、1.6T和3.2T产品逐步商业化，单模块功耗持续提升，传统风冷接近物理极限。机构预计，液冷光模块市场未来几年将保持高速增长。同时，XPO等新型液冷可插拔光模块标准推出，也有望推动液冷在高速互联领域进一步普及。\n综合多家机构观点，当前液冷产业链投资机会可重点关注三条主线。\n一是系统解决方案供应商，如英维克、申菱环境、高澜股份、同飞股份、曙光数创等，受益于液冷数据中心建设放量。\n二是核心零部件环节，包括飞龙股份、大元泵业、银轮股份、川环科技、强瑞技术、科创新源等，在冷板、CDU、泵、快接头及管路等核心部件领域具备竞争优势。\n三是液冷向光通信延伸带来的新增量机会，可关注鼎通科技、奕东电子、硕贝德、意华股份等液冷光模块相关厂商。\n风险提示:AI资本开支不及预期风险;液冷技术渗透进度不及预期风险;行业竞争加剧风险;国产算力建设进度不及预期风险。以上观点来自广发证券、中泰证券、华泰证券、国联民生证券、开源证券近期公开研究报告，不代表本平台立场，敬请投资者注意投资风险。\n\n\n--------\n搜索关键词：2026年6月5日 AI算力 液冷 英维克\n\n网页标题：INVT Showcases Next-Gen Solutions at the 3rd International AI Data Center Liquid Cooling Summit\n\n网页链接：https://www.invt.com/company-news/507.html\n\n发布时间：2026-06-01T00:00:00+08:00\n\n网页内容：INVT Showcases Next-Gen Solutions at the 3rd International AI Data Center Liquid Cooling Summit\nRelease time：2026-06-01 Click amount： 463\nRecently, the 3rd International AI Data Center Liquid Cooling Supply Chain Summit was held in Shenzhen. INVT was invited to attend, setting up a dedicated booth and delivering a keynote speech titled \"Gradual Smart Cooling: Breaking the Bottleneck with Hybrid Solutions.\" The company joined industry peers to explore the evolutionary path and industrial synergy of data center cooling technologies in the AI era.\n![](https://www.invt.com/ueditor/php/upload/image/20260601/1780295767506684.jpg)\nThe summit gathered numerous enterprises and industry experts from the entire liquid cooling supply chain to engage in deep discussions on cutting-edge trends, implementation paths, and ecosystem development. As a veteran in the network energy sector, INVT showcased its systematic thinking and full-stack solutions for a smooth transition from air cooling to liquid cooling, centered around its core concept of \"Air-Liquid Hybrid Cooling.\"\nGradual Smart Cooling: Breaking the Bottleneck with Hybrid Solutions\nAt the summit, the Head of INVT's Network Energy Product Line delivered a keynote speech. He pointed out that data centers are currently at a critical turning point of technological paradigm shift under the triple constraints of \"cooling, energy efficiency, and density.\" The power consumption of AI chips has completely surpassed the limit of traditional air cooling (approx. 750W), while stringent PUE policies run parallel to energy efficiency optimizations hitting their ceilings. Traditional air-cooling and AC power distribution architectures are struggling to support rack densities above 35 kW.\n![](https://www.invt.com/ueditor/php/upload/image/20260601/1780295791261482.jpg)\nMeanwhile, large-scale domestic deployment of liquid cooling still faces a gap due to market and chip supply constraints, with most projects remaining in the pilot phase. Facing this reality, INVT proposes \"Air-Liquid Hybrid Cooling\" as a feasible and essential transitional path at this stage. INVT advocates for maximizing the use of existing air-cooling infrastructure and achieving an integrated air-liquid design with a controllable air-to-liquid ratio. By precisely and gradually embedding liquid cooling capabilities through smart air-liquid fusion, enterprises can achieve controllable initial investment, flexible expansion, and smooth evolution.\n![](https://www.invt.com/ueditor/php/upload/image/20260601/1780295823115696.jpg)\nFull-Stack Smart Control: Win-Win Ecosystem\nINVT highlighted its UPS power supply product line, high-efficiency data center cooling solutions, and the Smart Series integrated data center solutions. Leveraging over a decade of R\u0026D in critical equipment and 100% in-house R\u0026D and manufacturing integration capabilities, INVT has built a comprehensive product matrix spanning power supply, thermal management, and dynamic environment monitoring.\n![](https://www.invt.com/ueditor/php/upload/image/20260601/1780295851268229.png)\nTo address different application scenarios, INVT launched targeted solutions covering five major scenarios: local high-density retrofitting of traditional air-cooled data centers, liquid cooling pilots for edge/micro nodes, air-liquid fusion deployment for new medium-to-large data centers, hyper-scale AIDC air-liquid hybrid clusters, and prefabricated air-liquid integrated containers. These solutions provide customers with a \"definitive, smooth, and efficient evolutionary path.\"\n![](https://www.invt.com/ueditor/php/upload/image/20260601/1780295878431879.jpg)\nINVT's successful participation in this summit not only demonstrates its technical strength but also marks an accelerated rollout of the company's forward-looking strategy in the liquid cooling track. Moving forward, INVT will remain committed to its mission of \"Leading Smart Industry, Co-creating a Zero-Carbon Future.\" With an open and collaborative approach, INVT will join hands with supply chain partners to build high-efficiency computing infrastructure for the AI era, contributing to the high-quality growth of the digital economy.\n![](https://www.invt.com/ueditor/php/upload/image/20260601/1780295900607297.jpg)\n\n========\n搜索关键词：2026年6月5日 固态电池 催化\n\n网页标题：周五A股投资参考(6月5号)_A股早8点\n\n网页链接：http://m.toutiao.com/group/7647667639057203718/\n\n发布时间：2026-06-05T06:25:56+08:00\n\n网页内容：券商启动全面自查 严禁为个别投资者提供特殊便利\n交易所明确，券商即刻启动交易单元全面自查，存量不合规配置须在3个月内整改完毕;交易所要求，应当做好交易单元内部分配，公平对待投资者，保护投资者特别是中小投资者合法权益，严禁为个别投资者提供特殊便利;会员应当为投资者公平分配交易网关，原则上不得为单一投资者分配单独使用的交易网关。\n英伟达推出首款完全开放全模态物理AI模型\n在2026中国台北GTC大会上，英伟达正式官宣重磅产品——NVIDIA Cosmos 3，这款面向物理AI的开放世界基础模型，凭借全新混合Transformer架构，打通视觉推理、世界生成、动作预测三大核心能力，成为全球首款完全开放的全模态物理AI模型。与此同时，英伟达牵头成立全球开发者协作联盟，正式拉起物理AI生态阵营，宣告物理AI规模化落地时代加速到来。\n央行:将开展5000亿元买断式逆回购操作\n央行公告，为保持银行体系流动性充裕，2026年6月5日，中国人民银行将以固定数量、利率招标、多重价位中标方式开展5000亿元买断式逆回购操作，期限为3个月(92天)，到期日为2026年9月5日(遇节假日顺延)。\n工业和信息化部办公厅发布关于组织开展6G创新发展部省协同试点专项行动的通知，到2029年，通过实施6G创新发展部省协同试点专项行动，进一步激发地方和企业创新活力，形成一批自主创新的6G技术方案，培育一批前景可观的新型业务应用场景，涌现一批丰富多样的新型终端产品，为6G商用落地提供有力支撑。\n其采用方形面板设计，以玻璃基板取代部分传统材料，意在支持更大尺寸AI与HPC芯片封装需求。\n一季度存储器价格全面上涨，各类产品季增幅度...\n据媒体报道，根据TrendForce集邦咨询最新存储器产业调查，20